---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    messageFontSize: 20
    noteFontSize: 20
    actorFontSize: 20
    actorMargin: 30
    width: 130
    noteMargin: 8
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant P as PWA
  participant A as Laravel API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  actor St as Staff

  U->>P: Press Check In
  Note over P: Reads position<br/>and accuracy
  P->>A: POST check-in
  A->>D: Open visit?
  alt Visit already open
    A-->>P: Same visit
  else No open visit
    Note over A: Check In service checks:<br/>current authorization,<br/>a current photo,<br/>gym open, accuracy 50 m<br/>or better, within 50 m<br/>of the gym. Coordinates<br/>are never stored.
    A->>D: Insert active visit,<br/>ends 2 h after Check In
    A-->>P: New visit
  end
  P-->>U: Gym ID

  St->>A: Who is inside?
  A->>D: Active visits
  St->>A: Check out
  A->>D: Mark checked out
  Note over A,D: Scheduler, every minute: closes<br/>visits 2 h after Check In,<br/>at a gym closure or at term end
